{"id":"43f4d656f23ee5d4","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-thm-silver.md","title":"Silver's Theorem","display":"thm-silver — Silver's Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-silver","aliases":["58-thm-silver"],"display":"thm-silver — Silver's Theorem","depends_on":["[[../batch04/58-df-singular.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-cardinalexpp.md]]","[[58-prop-cardinal-successor]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-silver"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-silver</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-silver — Silver's Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"02120307ea943054\" href=\"?note=02120307ea943054\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-singular.md\">../batch04/58-df-singular.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md\">../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"949691fe1747f59d\" href=\"?note=949691fe1747f59d\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-cardinalexpp.md\">../batch14/58-df-cardinalexpp.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d6baae1c4b76f905\" href=\"?note=d6baae1c4b76f905\" title=\"58-prop-cardinal-successor\">58-prop-cardinal-successor</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in V\">\\(\\kappa\\in V\\)</span> (candidate singular cardinal)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sing},\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sing},\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cf}:V\\to V\">\\(\\mathrm{cf}:V\\to V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d6baae1c4b76f905\" href=\"?note=d6baae1c4b76f905\" title=\"58-prop-cardinal-successor\">58-prop-cardinal-successor</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}silver}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Sing}(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\kappa\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\omega\\subseteq\\lambda\n\\to\\exists\\mu\\in V\\;\n(\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S(\\mu,\\lambda)\\land2^\\lambda=\\mu)\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists\\nu\\in V\\;\n(\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S(\\nu,\\kappa)\\land2^\\kappa=\\nu).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}silver}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Sing}(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\kappa\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\omega\\subseteq\\lambda\n\\to\\exists\\mu\\in V\\;\n(\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S(\\mu,\\lambda)\\land2^\\lambda=\\mu)\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists\\nu\\in V\\;\n(\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S(\\nu,\\kappa)\\land2^\\kappa=\\nu).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The conclusion and its hypotheses use the registered successor-cardinal relation instead of an unbound <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda^+\">\\(\\lambda^+\\)</span> operator.</li>\n<li>It was a breakthrough in cardinal arithmetic.</li>\n<li>The cofinality and cardinal-exponentiation operations now have direct dependencies; the hypothesis is exactly eventual GCH below a singular cardinal of uncountable cofinality.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch04/58-df-singular.md","status":"resolved","id":"02120307ea943054","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-singular.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"315ad00b8744fdfc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-cardinalexpp.md","status":"resolved","id":"949691fe1747f59d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-cardinalexpp.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-prop-cardinal-successor","status":"resolved","id":"d6baae1c4b76f905","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-prop-cardinal-successor]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-prop-cardinal-successor","status":"resolved","id":"d6baae1c4b76f905","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-prop-cardinal-successor]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sing},\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cf}:V\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}silver}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{Sing}(\\kappa)\\land\\omega<\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\kappa\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\omega\\subseteq\\lambda\n\\to\\exists\\mu\\in V\\;\n(\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S(\\mu,\\lambda)\\land2^\\lambda=\\mu)\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\to\\exists\\nu\\in V\\;\n(\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S(\\nu,\\kappa)\\land2^\\kappa=\\nu).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\lambda^+","display":false}],"bytes":1420,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4421","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-thm-silver.md|58-thm-silver]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["02120307ea943054","5fb1c2241d1943d1","315ad00b8744fdfc","949691fe1747f59d","d6baae1c4b76f905"]}